 srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4910x3274+0+0/resize/400/quality/85/format/webp/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnpr-production-npr.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com%2Fbrightspot%2F63%2F6a%2Ff53dbeec4157b3605bb867f6be2a%2Fap26329787202300.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4910x3274+0+0/resize/600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnpr-production-npr.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com%2Fbrightspot%2F63%2F6a%2Ff53dbeec4157b3605bb867f6be2a%2Fap26329787202300.jpg 600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4910x3274+0+0/resize/800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnpr-production-npr.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com%2Fbrightspot%2F63%2F6a%2Ff53dbeec4157b3605bb867f6be2a%2Fap26329787202300.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4910x3274+0+0/resize/900/quality/85/format/webp/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnpr-production-npr.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com%2Fbrightspot%2F63%2F6a%2Ff53dbeec4157b3605bb867f6be2a%2Fap26329787202300.jpg 900w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4910x3274+0+0/resize/1200/quality/85/format/webp/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnpr-production-npr.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com%2Fbrightspot%2F63%2F6a%2Ff53dbeec4157b3605bb867f6be2a%2Fap26329787202300.jpg 1200w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4910x3274+0+0/resize/1600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnpr-production-npr.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com%2Fbrightspot%2F63%2F6a%2Ff53dbeec4157b3605bb867f6be2a%2Fap26329787202300.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4910x3274+0+0/resize/1800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnpr-production-npr.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com%2Fbrightspot%2F63%2F6a%2Ff53dbeec4157b3605bb867f6be2a%2Fap26329787202300.jpg 1800w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4910x3274+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnpr-production-npr.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com%2Fbrightspot%2F63%2F6a%2Ff53dbeec4157b3605bb867f6be2a%2Fap26329787202300.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1025px) 650px, calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/webp" /&gt;             &lt;img src="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4910x3274+0+0/resize/1100/quality/50/format/webp/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnpr-production-npr.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com%2Fbrightspot%2F63%2F6a%2Ff53dbeec4157b3605bb867f6be2a%2Fap26329787202300.jpg" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4910x3274+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnpr-production-npr.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com%2Fbrightspot%2F63%2F6a%2Ff53dbeec4157b3605bb867f6be2a%2Fap26329787202300.jpg" class="img" alt="Waves pound the Pacifica Municipal Pier after a portion collapsed during high surf and tides in Pacifica, Calif., Wednesday, Nov. 25, 2026." loading="lazy" /&gt;         &lt;/picture&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="credit-caption"&gt;     &lt;div class="caption-wrap"&gt;         &lt;div class="caption" aria-label="Image caption"&gt;             &lt;p&gt;                 Waves pound the Pacifica Municipal Pier after a portion collapsed during high surf and tides in Pacifica, Calif., Wednesday, Nov. 25, 2026.                 &lt;b class="credit" aria-label="Image credit"&gt;                                          Noah Berger/AP                                      &lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;b class="hide-caption"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;             &lt;/p&gt;         &lt;/div&gt;               &lt;button class="toggle-caption" aria-label=""&gt;               &lt;svg class="icon icon--info"&gt;&lt;use href="#icon-info"&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;               &lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;abbr title="Toggle Caption" class="toggle-caption__info"&gt;i&lt;/abbr&gt;              &lt;/button&gt;     &lt;/div&gt;       &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;p&gt;Several areas were also hit by major flooding, including Old Town Alexandria, Virginia, and Atlantic City, New Jersey, where some low-lying areas had close to 2 to 3 feet of water, according to city authorities.&lt;/p&gt;       &lt;p&gt;And there's more flooding forecast. The National Weather Service issued a coastal flood warning for the Washington DC area on Friday, saying the warning was in effect until 6 pm ET.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;"The unprotected area on the Southwest Waterfront at the DC Seafood Market is expected to flood," the weather service said.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;"Take the necessary actions to protect flood-prone property. If travel is required, do not drive around barricades or through water of unknown depth," the &lt;a href="https://forecast.weather.gov/wwamap/wwatxtget.php?cwa=LWX&amp;wwa=coastal%20flood%20warning" target="_blank"&gt;statement added.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;On the other side of the country, the West Coast was hit by King Tides with strong waves battering the Bay Area in recent days. King Tides happen regularly, but they have been made worse by climate change and warming oceans, as well as a particularly strong El Niño.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;Part of the Pacifica Pier south of San Francisco collapsed on Wednesday, roads saw some flooding and some homes along the coast have been affected.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div id="resg-s1-156001" class="bucketwrap image large"&gt;             &lt;div     class="imagewrap has-source-dimensions"     data-crop-type=""     style="         --source-width: 5223;         --source-height: 3482;     " &gt;         &lt;picture&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/5223x3482+0+0/resize/400/quality/85/format/webp/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnpr-production-npr.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com%2Fbrightspot%2F49%2Fe1%2Ff426a1424cf28acecd6d3dcb0bb3%2Fap26329010191558.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/5223x3482+0+0/resize/600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnpr-produ